    "Starting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting manually can prompt for your Mac password. Automatic starts and retries use non-interactive sudo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手动启动时可能需要输入 Mac 密码。自动启动和重试使用非交互式 sudo。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Survive brief network drops": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "容忍短暂断网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sys off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sys on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sys on routes all of this Mac's traffic through the proxy (%@ is your current network service); Sys off restores it. Run them in a terminal; needs an admin account. Sys off stays shown here while the tunnel is down.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「开启代理」将此 Mac 的系统流量通过代理转发（当前网络服务为 %@）。「关闭代理」可恢复直连，隧道断开时仍会显示。请使用管理员账户在终端运行这些命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TCP Connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP 连接"
          }
        }
